  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "चाहना means want.\nवह नौकरी चाहता है । He wants a job.\nचाहना is often used with infinitives.\nसाड़ी पहनना चाहती है । She wants to wear a sari.\nउसके बारे में बताना चाहता हूँ । I want to tell about that.\nInfinitives are used before a few other verbs.\nक्या वे मोटर चलाना जानती हैं ? Does she know how to drive?\nक्या आप लिखना सीखते हैं ? Are you learning to write?\nA repeated interrogative asks for an itemized list.\nकौन कौन आना चाहते हैं ? Who-all want to come?\nक्या क्या देखना चाहता है ? What-all does he want to see?\nकहां कहां जाना चाहती है ? Where do you want to go?\nAfter is expressed by adverbial (oblique) phrases with बाद :\nबाद में — afterwards\nउसके बाद — after that\nउसके फ़ौरन बाद — immediately after that\nउसके दो दिन बाद — two days after that\nभारत पहुँचने के बाद — after arriving in India\nक्यों means why? The answer may use क्योंकि because."
    }
